~ start
$> GlobalVars.visited_bakery = true
Patrick: Heyy, how's it going ?
- Good and you ?
Patrick: It's going fine.
Patrick: Oh ! By the way, I prepared a cake for your little sibling's birthday
if GlobalVars.bought_cake_superette:
	=> supermarket_cake
else:
	=> no_cake
=> END

~ no_cake
- You're an angel, Patrick !
Patrick: You're the one who's a blessing.
Patrick: So, should I wrap the cake ?
- Not yet.
	Patrick: Oh ? Really ? Well... that's okay... Maybe another time then.
	Patrick: I'll stay there in case you decide to take me- [shake rate=20 level=10] I mean my cake [/shake] with you.
	- I'll see. See you around Patrick.
	Patrick: Farewel...
	$> title = "waiting"
	=> END
- Yes please !
	=> buy_cake
=> END

~ buy_cake
$> close_up_start_animation = "content"
$> GlobalVars.bought_cake_bakery = true
Patrick: Wonderful ! I knew you'd loke it
(As Patrick hands you the cake, his hands brushes against yours)
- Thank you Patrick !
- I'll think of you when I eat it !
Patrick: See you later cinnamon roll
$> title = "good_ending"
=> END

~ supermarket_cake
$> close_up_start_animation = "triste"
- Thanks, but I already bought one at the convenience store
Patrick: Ah ?
Patrick: So I baked this delicious cake specially for you, and you don't want any of it ?
Patrick: I really thought you were a faithful client...
- I'm sorry Patrick
- I swear it's not what it looks like !
- ...
Patrick: I thought there was something special between us.
Patrick: A trusting relationship between a baker and his favorite customer.
Patrick: But not only were you unfaithfull to me ! You did it with my wife !
Patrick: When you know [shake rate=40 level=20] perfectly well [/shake] that her buisness is bleeding the bakery dry...
Patrick: I can't believe you'd do buisness with this market snake !
- It's just that the convienience store is closer !
- This has nothing to do with us, I just wanted to buy a cake !
- ...
Patrick: I get it, you know...
Patrick: To you, this was nothing more than a financial exchange. In your eyes, I am nothing more but a comodity.
Patrick: To you, I nothing but a baker !
Patrick: Well, to me, you are nothing but a stranger.
- I'm begging you Patrick, one more chance ! I'll be faithfull this time !
- I wanted to eat someone else's cake just to remind myself of how superior yours are !
- ...
Patrick: Leave. I want nothing to do with cheaters
$> title = "bad_ending"
=> bad_ending

~ waiting
Patrick: ... Did you change your ming
if GlobalVars.bought_cake_superette:
	=> supermarket_cake
else:
	- No, just looking around.
		Patrick: Fine, it's not like I care wheter you buy the cake I made especially for you...
	- Yes, please, wrap the cake
		=> buy_cake
=> END

~ bad_ending
Patrick: Go back to Yvonne's arms if you love her industrial cake so much.
=> END

~ good_ending
Patrick: [wave amp=10 freq=3] Welcome back strawberry pie~.
=> END

~ bad_ending50
Patrick: Go [shake rate=40 level=20] die [/shake] in Yvonne's arms if you love her industrial cake so much.
=> END

~ good_ending60
Patrick: [wave amp=10 freq=3] Welcome back strawberry pie~.
Patrick: [wave amp=30 freq=1] I ate too much yesterday, I'm feeling sick.
=> END

~ bad_ending65
Patrick: [wave amp=30 freq=1] I don't feel so good.
Patrick: Oh, hell-.[shake rate=40 level=50].. GET OUT OF MY SHOP !
=> END

~ global75
Patrick: [wave amp=30 freq=1] Why is everything wierd ?
=> END

~ global90
Patrick: [shake rate=40 level=20] AAAAAAAAH, WE'RE GONNA DIE !!!
=> END